A '''mollusk'''<ref name="Thrawn">[[Thrawn (novel)|''Thrawn'']]</ref> or '''mollusc'''<ref name="Survivor">''[[Star Wars Jedi: Survivor]]''</ref> was any of numerous [[species]] that typically had a soft meaty body and a protective shell. Examples included the [[Paklarn]] [[grist mollusk]]s.<ref name="Thrawn" /> [[Sentience|Non-sentient]] mollusks were a source of [[Foodstuff|food]] to certain intelligent species, like the [[Gungan]].<ref name="db">{{Databank|gungan|Gungan}}</ref> The meat of mollusks could be used to make [[mollusk jerky]], which was considered a delicacy on the [[Inner Rim Territories|Inner Rim]] [[planet]] [[Pijal]].<ref name="Master & Apprentice">''[[Master & Apprentice]]''</ref> There also existed at least [[Intelligent mollusk|one]] race of sentient mollusks.<ref name="Complete Locations">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref>

